{
  "slug": "wingspan",
  "name": "Wingspan",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Ask Claude about the contractors you pay through Wingspan, what you owe them, and what is holding up a payment, then onboard contractors and log payments as drafts, with a preview before anything is written. Requires a Wingspan account; bundles the Wingspan MCP server (OAuth on first use).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `checking-payments` (Look up what a company owes its contractors through Wingspan and what has happened to a particular payment), `connect` (Check the Wingspan connection and report who it is signed in as), `creating-draft-payables` (Create draft payables — new payment obligations to contractors — in Wingspan), `finding-contractors` (Find, filter and inspect the contractors a company pays through Wingspan, including who still has onboarding paperwork outstanding), `onboarding-contractors` (Add contractors to Wingspan, assign them to an existing engagement and send their invites), `outstanding` (List the contractors who have one named onboarding requirement outstanding, such as a W-9, a certificate of insurance…), `troubleshooting-connection` (Diagnose Wingspan connection and permission problems), `using-wingspan-tools` (The shared rules every Wingspan tool call follows: ids, paging, previewing a write, and what the tools cannot…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `wingspan`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wingspan@claude-plugins-official` from `wingspanHQ/mcp-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
